          "text": "Quarterly Field Report",
          "lineHeight": 0.032725472432135597
        },
        {
          "lineHeight": 0.020335056006854278,
          "text": "The survey ran from 3 March to 28 April across four regions. Response rates were higher than expected in the north, where volunteers visited every household twice before marking it as absent.",
